{"id":"2022-zhejiang-19","year":2022,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":19,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，已知 $ABCD$ 和 $CDEF$ 都是直角梯形，$AB\\parallel DC$，$DC\\parallel EF$，$AB=5$，$DC=3$，$EF=1$，$\\angle BAD=\\angle CDE=60^\\circ$，二面角 $F-DC-B$ 的平面角为 $60^\\circ$. 设 $M$，$N$ 分别为 $AE$，$BC$ 的中点. \\mathrm{i}tem 证明：$FN\\perp AD$； \\mathrm{i}tem 求直线 $BM$ 与平面 $ADE$ 所成角的正弦值. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} [图]","options":null,"answer":"\\mathrm{i}tem 证明见解析. \\mathrm{i}tem $\\frac{5\\sqrt7}{14}$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["空间向量","线面角"],"difficulty":"中档","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2022/2022浙江.pdf","sha":"754cf398b650e7148a5b5cd66118113271d8abb8","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图，已知 \\(ABCD\\) 和 \\(CDEF\\) 都是直角梯形，\\(AB\\parallel DC\\)，\\(DC\\parallel EF\\)，\\(AB=5\\)，\\(DC=3\\)，\\(EF=1\\)，\\(\\angle BAD=\\angle CDE=60^\\circ\\)，二面角 \\(F-DC-B\\) 的平面角为 \\(60^\\circ\\). 设 \\(M\\)，\\(N\\) 分别为 \\(AE\\)，\\(BC\\) 的中点.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明：\\(FN\\perp AD\\)；\n\n\\item 求直线 \\(BM\\) 与平面 \\(ADE\\) 所成角的正弦值.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=0.34\\textwidth]{img/2022/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 证明见解析.\n\n\\item \\(\\dfrac{5\\sqrt7}{14}\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","figure_refs":["img/2022/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2022/zhejiang/q19_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2022/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8b79a45e58dd19e5776c15036232a4a4d968a428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_o