{"id":"2022-zhejiang-20","year":2022,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":20,"question_type":"solution","stem":"已知等差数列 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的首项 $a_1=-1$，公差 $d>1$. 记 $\\{a_n\\}$ 的前 $n$ 项和为 $S_n$（$n\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{N}^*$）. \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $S_4-2a_2a_3+6=0$，求 $S_n$； \\mathrm{i}tem 若对于每个 $n\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{N}^*$，存在实数 $c_n$，使 $a_n+c_n$，$a_{n+1}+4c_n$，$a_{n+2}+15c_n$ 成等比数列，求 $d$ 的取值范围. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","options":null,"answer":"\\mathrm{i}tem $S_n=\\frac{3n^2-5n}{2}$，$n\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{N}^*$. \\mathrm{i}tem $1<d\\le 2$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["等差数列","等比数列"],"difficulty":"中档","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2022/2022浙江.pdf","sha":"754cf398b650e7148a5b5cd66118113271d8abb8","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"已知等差数列 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 的首项 \\(a_1=-1\\)，公差 \\(d>1\\). 记 \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) 的前 \\(n\\) 项和为 \\(S_n\\)（\\(n\\in\\N^*\\)）.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(S_4-2a_2a_3+6=0\\)，求 \\(S_n\\)；\n\n\\item 若对于每个 \\(n\\in\\N^*\\)，存在实数 \\(c_n\\)，使 \\(a_n+c_n\\)，\\(a_{n+1}+4c_n\\)，\\(a_{n+2}+15c_n\\) 成等比数列，求 \\(d\\) 的取值范围.\n\\end{enumerate}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item \\(S_n=\\dfrac{3n^2-5n}{2}\\)，\\(n\\in\\N^*\\).\n\n\\item \\(1<d\\le 2\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2022/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8b79a45e58dd19e5776c15036232a4a4d968a428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"7828c1b848809cd0bff5677032ebd34a8fe5f23b48b1b7dfe64d2902bc2007e6","answer_sha256":"262847459676f8ee2bf6536c35c136cbcc6fe0a77a2c8efc09630c41b57b7268"}}
{"id":"2022-zhejiang-21","year":2022,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":21,"question_type":"solution","stem":"如图，已知椭圆 $\\frac{x^2}{12}+y^2=1$. 设 $A$，$B$ 是椭圆上异于 $P(0,1)$ 的两点，且点 $Q\\left(0,\\frac12\\right)$ 在线段 $AB$ 上，直线 $PA$，$PB$ 分别交直线 $y=-\\frac12x+3$ 于 $C$，$D$ 两点. \\mathrm{i}tem 求点 $P$ 到椭圆上点的距离的最大值； \\mathrm{i}tem 求 $|CD|$ 的最小值. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} [图]","options":null,"answer":"\\mathrm{i}tem $\\frac{12\\sqrt{11}}{11}$. \\mathrm{i}tem $\\frac{6\\sqrt5}{5}$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["椭圆","直线与圆锥曲线","最值"],"difficulty":"中档","needs_figure":true,"source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2022/2022浙江.pdf","sha":"754cf398b650e7148a5b5cd66118113271d8abb8","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"如图，已知椭圆 \\(\\frac{x^2}{12}+y^2=1\\). 设 \\(A\\)，\\(B\\) 是椭圆上异于 \\(P(0,1)\\) 的两点，且点 \\(Q\\left(0,\\frac12\\right)\\) 在线段 \\(AB\\) 上，直线 \\(PA\\)，\\(PB\\) 分别交直线 \\(y=-\\frac12x+3\\) 于 \\(C\\)，\\(D\\) 两点.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求点 \\(P\\) 到椭圆上点的距离的最大值；\n\n\\item 求 \\(|CD|\\) 的最小值.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n\\bitmapfigure[max width=0.40\\textwidth]{img/2022/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png}","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item \\(\\dfrac{12\\sqrt{11}}{11}\\).\n\n\\item \\(\\dfrac{6\\sqrt5}{5}\\).\n\\end{enumerate}","figure_refs":["img/2022/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png"],"figure_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation/4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8/img/2022/zhejiang/q21_fig1.png"],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2022/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8b79a45e58dd19e5776c15036232a4a4d968a428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified_with_figure_dependency","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_ch