{"id":"2022-zhejiang-22","year":2022,"subject":"数学","exam_type":"普通高考","paper":"浙江卷","regions":["浙江"],"question_no":22,"question_type":"solution","stem":"设函数 $f(x)=\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{2x}+\\ln x$（$x>0$）. \\mathrm{i}tem 求 $f(x)$ 的单调区间； \\mathrm{i}tem 已知 $a$，$b\\mathrm{i}n\\mathbb{R}$，曲线 $y=f(x)$ 上不同的三点 $(x_1,f(x_1))$，$(x_2,f(x_2))$，$(x_3,f(x_3))$ 处的切线都经过点 $(a,b)$. 证明： \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $a>\\mathrm{e}$，则 $0<b-f(a)<\\frac12\\left(\\frac{a}{\\mathrm{e}}-1\\right)$； \\mathrm{i}tem 若 $0<a<\\mathrm{e}$，$x_1<x_2<x_3$，则 $\\frac{2}{\\mathrm{e}}+\\frac{\\mathrm{e}-a}{6\\mathrm{e}^2}<\\frac1{x_1}+\\frac1{x_3}<\\frac2a-\\frac{\\mathrm{e}-a}{6\\mathrm{e}^2}$. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate} （注：$\\mathrm{e}=2.71828\\cdots$ 是自然对数的底数）","options":null,"answer":"\\mathrm{i}tem 减区间为 $\\left(0,\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{2}\\right)$，增区间为 $\\left(\\frac{\\mathrm{e}}{2},+\\mathrm{i}nfty\\right)$. \\mathrm{i}tem 证明见解析. \\mathrm{e}nd{enumerate}","analysis":null,"knowledge_points":["导数","函数单调性","切线"],"difficulty":"难题","source":{"repository":"deekur/gaokaomath","file":"普通高考/2022/2022浙江.pdf","sha":"754cf398b650e7148a5b5cd66118113271d8abb8","license":"CC BY 4.0"},"stem_latex":"设函数 \\(f(x)=\\frac{\\e}{2x}+\\ln x\\)（\\(x>0\\)）.\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 求 \\(f(x)\\) 的单调区间；\n\n\\item 已知 \\(a\\)，\\(b\\in\\R\\)，曲线 \\(y=f(x)\\) 上不同的三点 \\((x_1,f(x_1))\\)，\\((x_2,f(x_2))\\)，\\((x_3,f(x_3))\\) 处的切线都经过点 \\((a,b)\\). 证明：\n\n\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 若 \\(a>\\e\\)，则 \\(0<b-f(a)<\\frac12\\left(\\frac{a}{\\e}-1\\right)\\)；\n\n\\item 若 \\(0<a<\\e\\)，\\(x_1<x_2<x_3\\)，则 \\(\\frac{2}{\\e}+\\frac{\\e-a}{6\\e^2}<\\frac1{x_1}+\\frac1{x_3}<\\frac2a-\\frac{\\e-a}{6\\e^2}\\).\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{enumerate}\n\n（注：\\(\\e=2.71828\\cdots\\) 是自然对数的底数）","options_latex":null,"answer_latex":"\\begin{enumerate}\n\\item 减区间为 \\(\\left(0,\\dfrac{\\e}{2}\\right)\\)，增区间为 \\(\\left(\\dfrac{\\e}{2},+\\infty\\right)\\).\n\n\\item 证明见解析.\n\\end{enumerate}","needs_figure":false,"figure_refs":[],"figure_urls":[],"reference":{"repository":"DxAThing/Gaokao-Math-Problems-Compilation","file":"content/2022/zhejiang.tex","commit":"4b69f48467d7883e1e9cf816680347ce34583ba8","blob_sha":"8b79a45e58dd19e5776c15036232a4a4d968a428","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},"verification":{"status":"verified","verified_at":"2026-08-31","methods":["upstream_pdf_git_blob_sha","pinned_reference_transcription","pinned_reference_answer_or_short_solution","secondary_answer_check","structural_validation"],"stem_sha256":"57b02c6fc50ec6a2c47e0a8f7ff9cfa5b2178a3d80fff8898a314dec29c4d3a6","answer_sha256":"31cd3e794b8b15a6b404140257f2b7e8415a4905d2b0b73c7a371c46fe3e9ec0"}}
